Value PORT_ID (\S+)
Value ADMIN_STATE (\S+)
Value LINK_STATE (\S+)
Value OPER_STATE (\S+)
Value CFG_MTU (\d+)
Value OPER_MTU (\d+)

Start
  ^Ports on Slot
  ^=+
  ^Port\s+Admin
  ^Id\s+State
  ^-+
  ^${PORT_ID}\s+${ADMIN_STATE}\s+${LINK_STATE}\s+${OPER_STATE}\s+${CFG_MTU}\s+${OPER_MTU}\b -> Record
  ^\s*$$